      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "1-Button Dropdown Toolbar & Step 2 MENA Normalization Popover",
      "items": [
        "DataExchangeToolbarActions renders one @core/ui/dropdown-menu trigger inside CrmSectionHeader (with hideToolbarActions: true in CRUD) and flex-wraps GenericCrudView so Table/Kanban toggles never clip.",
        "DataExchangeStudioOverlay fixes Cancel/X overlap and a11y nesting, while ColumnNormalizationPopover configures all 17 DataExchangeTransformRule toggles with live Raw -> Normalized preview."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "3-Route Admin MVVM Module, Concurrency-Safe Cancel & Live Dock",
      "items": [
        "The 5-layer SOLID MVVM @modules/data-transfer module replaces legacy hub views across /admin/data-exchange, /jobs, and /presets using GenericCrudView<T> with Search/Status filtering.",
        "DataTransferImmediateWorker scopes queued jobs via .IgnoreQueryFilters() + DataExchangeAmbientContext, handles DbUpdateConcurrencyException cancel races, and streams 2s updates to DataExchangeFloatingDock."
